# Worktrees the Cannon makes for cards. Never committed.
.potato/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
test-results.xml

# Generated by every Gate run, and never the same bytes twice. Tracking them made
# every card branch conflict with main on a machine-written file. The receipt in
# journal/receipts.jsonl is the record that a Gate ran and what it said; these are its
# scratch output, regenerated wherever the Gate runs. Ruled 2026-09-20.
#
# A pattern rather than two names, because the Gate writes whichever manifests its
# version writes: 0.5.1 wrote one, the version after it added `trace-manifest.v5beta`
# beside it, and the next one is not this file's business to predict. Two names meant a
# machine-written file appeared untracked on a machine with a newer bundle.
trace-manifest*.json
